data: {"type":"message_completed","message_id":"msg-5d5e5708f67046ab","content":"```html\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Diak — Local AI Provider Bridge for macOS</title>\n  <style>\n    :root {\n      --bg: #0b1020;\n      --panel: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n      --panel-2: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\n      --text: #f7f9ff;\n      --muted: #b8c1d9;\n      --accent: #7c5cff;\n      --accent-2: #25d6a2;\n      --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);\n      --shadow: 0 24px 80px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);\n    }\n\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;\n      color: var(--text);\n      background:\n        radial-gradient(circle at 20% 10%, rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.42), transparent 34%),\n        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 20%, rgba(37, 214, 162, 0.28), transparent 30%),\n        linear-gradient(180deg, #0b1020 0%, #111831 52%, #090d1a 100%);\n      min-height: 100vh;\n    }\n\n    .page {\n      width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 40px));\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      padding: 28px 0 56px;\n    }\n\n    header {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      gap: 16px;\n      margin-bottom: 72px;\n    }\n\n    .brand {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 12px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      letter-spacing: -0.03em;\n      font-size: 22px;\n    }\n\n    .logo {\n      width: 38px;\n      height: 38px;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-2));\n      box-shadow: 0 12px 36px rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.35);\n    }\n\n    nav {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 10px;\n      color: var(--muted);\n      font-size: 14px;\n    }\n\n    nav span {\n      padding: 9px 12px;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);\n    }\n\n    .hero {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;\n      gap: 44px;\n      align-items: center;\n    }\n\n    .eyebrow {\n      display: inline-flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      padding: 8px 12px;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(37, 214, 162, 0.34);\n      background: rgba(37, 214, 162, 0.1);\n      color: #bfffea;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      margin-bottom: 20px;\n    }\n\n    h1 {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: clamp(44px, 7vw, 78px);\n      line-height: 0.92;\n      letter-spacing: -0.075em;\n    }\n\n    .lead {\n      max-width: 620px;\n      margin: 24px 0 0;\n      color: var(--muted);\n      font-size: clamp(18px, 2vw, 22px);\n      line-height: 1.5;\n    }\n\n    .nonce {\n      display: inline-block;\n      margin-top: 24px;\n      padding: 12px 14px;\n      border-radius: 14px;\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);\n      color: #ffffff;\n      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;\n      font-size: 13px;\n      overflow-wrap: anywhere;\n      box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n    }\n\n    .actions {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\n      gap: 12px;\n      margin-top: 30px;\n    }\n\n    .button {\n      appearance: none;\n      border: 0;\n      border-radius: 14px;\n      padding: 14px 18px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      color: #080b14;\n      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff, #dfe7ff);\n      box-shadow: 0 18px 44px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);\n      text-decoration: none;\n    }\n\n    .button.secondary {\n      color: var(--text);\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      box-shadow: none;\n    }\n\n    .card {\n      position: relative;\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--panel-2), var(--panel));\n      border-radius: 28px;\n      padding: 22px;\n      box-shadow: var(--shadow);\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .card::before {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      inset: -80px -60px auto auto;\n      width: 210px;\n      height: 210px;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      background: rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.32);\n      filter: blur(12px);\n    }\n\n    .window {\n      position: relative;\n      border-radius: 20px;\n      background: #0d1327;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);\n      overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .bar {\n      height: 42px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n      padding: 0 14px;\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n    }\n\n    .dot {\n      width: 10px;\n      height: 10px;\n      border-radius: 999px;\n      background: #ff5f57;\n    }\n\n    .dot:nth-child(2) { background: #ffbd2e; }\n    .dot:nth-child(3) { background: #28c840; }\n\n    .terminal {\n      padding: 22px;\n      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      line-height: 1.75;\n      color: #cfe1ff;\n    }\n\n    .terminal .ok {\n      color: #77f2c8;\n    }\n\n    .terminal .muted {\n      color: #7f8cad;\n    }\n\n    .features {\n      display: grid;\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n      gap: 14px;\n      margin-top: 54px;\n    }\n\n    .feature {\n      padding: 20px;\n      border-radius: 20px;\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07);\n      border: 1px solid var(--border);\n    }\n\n    .feature strong {\n      display: block;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n      font-size: 16px;\n    }\n\n    .feature p {\n      margin: 0;\n      color: var(--muted);\n      line-height: 1.5;\n      font-size: 14px;\n    }\n\n    footer {\n      margin-top: 54px;\n      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.52);\n      font-size: 13px;\n      text-align: center;\n    }\n\n    @media (max-width: 840px) {\n      header {\n        margin-bottom: 42px;\n      }\n\n      nav {\n        display: none;\n      }\n\n      .hero {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      }\n\n      .features {\n        grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <header>\n      <div class=\"brand\">\n        <div class=\"logo\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n        <span>Diak</span>\n      </div>\n      <nav aria-label=\"Product highlights\">\n        <span>macOS-native</span>\n        <span>Local providers</span>\n        <span>Canvas-ready</span>\n      </nav>\n    </header>\n\n    <section class=\"hero\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"eyebrow\">Provider bridge verified</div>\n        <h1>Run AI providers through one clean desktop layer.</h1>\n        <p class=\"lead\">\n          Diak gives builders a local macOS command center for connecting AI runtimes,\n          testing provider contracts, and shipping reliable workflows without brittle glue code.\n        </p>\n        <div class=\"nonce\">DIAK_PROVIDER_CANVAS_20260510-122235_26282</div>\n        <div class=\"actions\">\n          <a class=\"button\" href=\"#features\">Explore Diak</a>\n          <a class=\"button secondary\" href=\"#status\">View provider status</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <aside class=\"card\" id=\"status\" aria-label=\"Diak provider status preview\">\n        <div class=\"window\">\n          <div class=\"bar\">\n            <span class=\"dot\"></span>\n            <span class=\"dot\"></span>\n            <span class=\"dot\"></span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"terminal\">\n            <div><span class=\"muted\">$</span> diak provider test</div>\n            <div class=\"ok\">✓ Hermes bridge online</div>\n            <div class=\"ok\">✓ Contract response valid</div>\n            <div class=\"ok\">✓ Canvas render target ready</div>\n            <br />\n            <div><span class=\"muted\">mode:</span> local production proof</div>\n            <div><span class=\"muted\">status:</span> shippable foundation</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </aside>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"features\" id=\"features\">\n      <div class=\"feature\">\n        <strong>Provider abstraction</strong>\n        <p>Connect local and remote AI backends behind a stable app-facing contract.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"feature\">\n        <strong>Desktop workflow control</strong>\n        <p>Keep testing, routing, and provider execution close to the Mac environment you build in.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"feature\">\n        <strong>Canvas-friendly output</strong>\n        <p>Render polished artifacts, demos, and verification pages directly inside Diak Canvas.</p>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <footer>\n      Diak helps product builders turn local AI infrastructure into dependable application workflows.\n    </footer>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>\n```"}

